{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42789","headline":"中春登楼 二 · 刘兼","name":"中春登楼 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古今通塞莫咨嗟，谩把霜髯敌岁华。\n失手已慙蛇有足，用心休爲鼠无牙。\n九天云净方怜月，一夜风高便厌花。\n独倚郡楼人不会，钓舟春浪接平沙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42789.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42789","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}